# StatPitch credentials. Copy to .env for local development; .env is gitignored.
#
# Nothing here is required to run the API, build features, train, or serve
# predictions. Every source the model depends on is free and keyless. These are
# for the optional collector that corrects fixture dates and gathers lineups.
#
# In CI these live as GitHub Actions secrets, not in a file. They are NOT needed
# on Render: the collector runs offline in Actions, never on a request path, and
# the deployed image does not even install the scrapers.

# API-Football (https://www.api-football.com) — free tier, 100 requests/day.
# Used by scripts/collect_fixtures.py to confirm kickoff times and collect
# lineups. Absent, the collector is skipped and openfootball's provisional dates
# are served as-is, flagged with date_confirmed=false.
STATPITCH_API_FOOTBALL_KEY=

# football-data.org (https://www.football-data.org) — free tier, 10 requests/min.
# The PRIMARY source for confirming kickoff times: unlike API-Football's free
# plan it covers all five leagues in the current season. Absent, the collector
# falls back to API-Football and then to leaving dates provisional.
STATPITCH_FOOTBALL_DATA_ORG_KEY=

# Optional override of the daily hard stop (default 90, below the real 100 limit).
# STATPITCH_QUOTA_HARD_STOP=90

# The Odds API (https://the-odds-api.com) — free tier, 500 credits per MONTH.
#
# The only source covering the six cups nothing free can reach: FA Cup, Copa del
# Rey, Coppa Italia, Coupe de France, and both UEFA competitions. openfootball
# stopped publishing cup files and OpenLigaDB covers Germany alone.
#
# Fixtures cost nothing. `/events` is free, and that is all a fixture list needs,
# so a key buys cup fixtures and predictions at zero credit spend. Credits are
# only consumed by `/odds`, which nothing calls automatically — Phase C measured
# that no reference available in a live feed clears the validation bar, so there
# is currently no reason to spend them.
#
# Absent, the cups above simply have no fixtures and the API says so per
# competition.
STATPITCH_ODDS_API_KEY=
